      "side": 1,
      "message": "Implementation updating vbus_voltage_cache with SM5803_VBUS_INVALID_MV (-1) and configure its threshold (00h \u0026 FFh) whenever VBUS ADC disabled, leading to unstable USB2.0/Type-C behavior during 4.6.x testing. Therefore, change reverted for now vbus_voltage_cache \u0026 configure threshold only when valid ADC readings and removed SM5803_VBUS_INVALID_MV (-1) \u0026 SM5803_REG_GPADC_CONFIG1 used for digital presence when VBUS ADC disabled",
      "parentUuid": "3a585a8b_3c2d37ca",
